# Spec-driven TDD

This repository uses **spec → red → green → refactor**.

1. Read or update the relevant file under `specs/features/` before building a feature slice.
2. Role contracts live in `specs/agents/`; Cursor runtime agents live in `.cursor/agents/`.
3. No production code without a failing test first.
4. For multi-step work, the main agent orchestrates and launches `tester`, `implementer`, and `reviewer` via the Task tool instead of doing everything inline.
5. Bridge WhatsApp orchestration code belongs in `src/orchestration/`.
